### 1. GET All Events
GET http://localhost:5000/api/events

###

### 2. GET Single Event
GET http://localhost:5000/api/events/6ab9fffc86b9ee0604383a83

###

### 3. POST Create New Event
POST http://localhost:5000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "AI Workshop",
  "category": "Technical",
  "fee": 150,
  "seats": 40,
  "date": "2026-11-20"
}

###

### 4. PUT Update Event
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/events/6ab9fffc86b9ee0604383a83
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Robo Wars 2026",
  "category": "Robotics",
  "fee": 250,
  "seats": 25,
  "date": "2026-10-16"
}

###

### 5. DELETE Event (Remove duplicate)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/events/6ab9fffe86b9ee0604383a84